  "title": "Pakistan Top Corporate Financials, Taxation, and Effective Tax Rates (2020-2024)",
  "description": "Multi-year financial statements analysis and corporate tax contributions of leading listed companies on the Pakistan Stock Exchange (PSX), tracking revenue, pre-tax profits, tax provisions, effective tax rates (ETR), assets, and sectoral tax burdens across 15 industries.",
